{
  "_about": "The DEM sources that duckOSM knows (docs/reference/elevation-sources.md). One list, read by src/duckosm/dem_sources.py and by web/ground_step/. rank: 1 national DTM, 2 regional DTM, 3 global DTM, 4 global DSM, 5 other, 9 fallback. The order of the suggestions: rank, then resolution_m, then the order of this file. coverage: a bounding box [west, south, east, north] or a coarse polygon [[lon, lat], ...]; exclude lists boxes that the area must not touch. An area is covered when its whole box is inside. cors: true or false when a page can read the data URL (checked), null when nobody checked.",
